    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Behind Glass is the ultimate fish-keeping game, designed to deliver a <strong>relaxing</strong> yet deeply engaging experience for aquarium enthusiasts and casual players alike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re a passionate <strong>aquascaper</strong> or simply enjoy the calming beauty of underwater worlds, this game offers everything you need to create your dream aquarium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vast <strong>sandbox environment</strong> where you can design stunning <strong>3D aquariums</strong> with incredible <strong>creative freedom</strong>. Choose between freshwater and saltwater tanks, each offering unique challenges and opportunities to showcase your style. With access to over <strong>230 unique fish species</strong>, along with <strong>crabs</strong>, <strong>turtles</strong>, and <strong>axolotls</strong>, your tanks will be bursting with life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611580/extras/871c91893f69e55271f8e094e89c5944.avif?t=1751956254\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Behind Glass stands apart with its immersive water <strong>chemistry simulation</strong>, allowing players to delve into the science behind aquarium care. Adjust pH, salinity, and other parameters to create the perfect conditions for your aquatic friends. For those who prefer a more relaxed approach, the designer mode offers the freedom to focus on design and aesthetics without any constraints. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611580/extras/ebc5c6caa02d3b15c756301d5338239e.avif?t=1751956254\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Forget about grinding or locked content \u2014 everything is available right from the start. From vibrant fish to countless decorations, you\u2019ll have every tool at your disposal to craft aquariums that reflect your imagination. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive deep into the game\u2019s features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Instant access to a vast array of decorations, plants, and creatures. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed animations and <strong>realistic behaviors</strong> for fish and aquatic animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ability to <strong>mix and match species</strong> in diverse habitats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>meditative</strong>, <strong>stress-free</strong> atmosphere designed for relaxation. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No other fish tank simulation comes close to offering this level of <strong>depth and creativity</strong>. Whether you\u2019re a beginner or an experienced aquascaper, Behind Glass lets you build, customize, and manage stunning aquariums <strong>without limits</strong>. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start your aquascaping journey today and transform your virtual tanks into mesmerizing underwater worlds!</p>",
